  <para style="h">1 Byitusu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Byitusu Kpmisnuyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Byitusu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1By</para>
  <para style="mt1">Byitusu Kpmisnuyi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Gnaɓyi</para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Byitusu, Yeisu Kirisiti tnutnuloyi.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1PE 1:1">Kwo lo da Shekwoyi aza aknyiknyiyi nu, okwnula n ɓa gnamyi fyi n Pwontus aknyi, n Galatiya, Kapadosiya, Asiya ɓədo n Byitinyai, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />aza n a ɓə knyí ɓa vyi ɓəyekpe Shekwoyi Dada aɓo nya n ɓa ye ɓeɓelo dna n pmyapmya Zafnu tnutnu nya, ɓai kwu zhni Yeisu Kirisiti ɓəgbetuvyiyi njesnu ai kwu ɓa myi n əwo amiyii.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1PE 1:2">Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa kwu zhni əfye anya knaaknà kwoi gyiya.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi cici ntu awyetu wyewyeyi nya ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Cici zhni Shekwoyi nya nu n Dadai əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya! Ntu əwo snusnugye yaakwo ɓo, wo la yi shna ma fyi n awyetu wyewyeyi nya, dna n Yeisu Kirisiti kala la ń əfyi, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />wa lofyi n əyii fyi n əgwú n kwo taa fyi, n kwo taa wnuya, kwo kwa toya m nanyinanyi. Aa n əgwú yei yashi əfye lo n əshemi nu, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />əfye dna n gaiciyaganunui, a kwu fye shekna n Shekwoyi kalái nya əsa n gnyignyi ɓə ɓe n cei, n a ɓə kpekwoya wu dna n əsa kpmaknayi nu nyi. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Fyi n aɓo ye vnyanya fye nya agbmada yaakwo lo, kwo shikwonyi nsaiye, əsa fyewyi, kwo ɓa zè ge, fye ɓa gyeazhnì bwugbawnu nya ntu amwimwi ɓo gbowogbowo. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Amwumwu ye ɓa ɓe nabai ɓa wu kwo əfye gaiciyaganunui n zhni hnihnii nu, n kwo du zinali lo n apma, ədo n kwo wnuya kwo ai la kwo zhniaba n ənái nyi; kwoi ɓe n cicii, latu n mwamwai əsa n Yeisu Kirisiti ɓə kpeyaɓe ncei. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kwo shikwonyi fye too gye wo əwye m, fye ye wo lo; jesnu kwo shikwonyi fye ta gye wo əwye lo nsaiye m, fye kwu gaiciyaga dna n wo, jesnu fye nunui lo n agbmada latu nyai, n a taa shni əɓa əɓo da m, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ntuge fye zhi fyei gwo gyiba əfye gaiciyaganunui azozhiba nya nu; əkwo nu zhni gnyignyi əfye awyewyeyi nya.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Ntu n gnyignyi ye ɓo, sheaɓəgwognayi, n ɓa ɓə da shebmyashi ɓo n kwo ɓə ye kwa ɓe da fye nyi, ɓa ɓə la kwo pmigye n əwyei bmyibmyiyi njesnu n ɓahnii wnashi kəcii dəidəi. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Ɓa zhniatna ɓa kpe əsa ye, ɓədo n aɓoi n ɓa ɓə zhni; ədo n Kirisiti Zafnu n wo dna n ɓa nyi, ɓəi gnyi woi wu ɓa əɓo n kwo ɓe lo, Kirisiti azhnìgye nya, ɓədo n latui n kwo ɓə vyi n avnu nyi. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />A ɓə la kwo kpeyawu ɓa nge ɓa to ɓə zhi ɓai zhni əɓahni tnutnu nu m, ama əfye nya, she ɓa ɓə da fye aɓo, n aza yi n ɓa ɓə zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya ga fye nsaiye nyi, dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi, n əshemi ɓə tnu n woi nyi. Kwo amaləka ɓa ɓəi zhi n pwawoi ɓa pmi aɓo ye gye.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fye kwu zhni agyigyiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Ntucenu, əfye abwugba ɓa la kpmagyewyi fya kwu əfyehni wnashi dəidəi, fye la əwyetu n shebmyashi n a ɓəi ɓe fye ncei, she a ɓə la Yeisu Kirisiti kpeyawu dna n əwo ɓeɓe əsa. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ngye aɓyi aɓəgbetuvyiyi, fye to je gwodu fyi n aɓəmwi nukwoi pwawo n fye ɓə ncei shiɓwa əsa n fye ɓə fyi n tnagənyikpe nyi m. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ama n ɓwasnu shi əza n wo ɓə yi fye, wo gyigyiyi lo nyi, ntulonu fye kwu zhi n gyigyiyi n ɓəhoɓəhoi n fye zhni; <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />ntuge a cei kakpe lo: “Fye kwu zhni n agyigyiyi, ntuge mi zhni gyigyiyi nu.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Shikwonyi fye yi Dada nu n wo da zahozahoyi tnutnu owa n tna-awyekwo nyi, fye gyianyì ngye azhiɓeyi fyi n ədna mwamwaga nya. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ntuge fye kpəlo nge toge n anya agbmazhnii nu ngye azulufa kwo zinali n a ɓə gnyi fye n anyìgyi gbəloi n əfye azakwoyi ɓə fa shi fye nyi m, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ama n ami anakwoi Kirisiti nyai, Kwugyasnáyi tna-ababalai kwo tna ogwnutui. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />A ɓə la wo knyi a kpe anyì zhni, ama a la wo kpeyawu dna əsa kpmaknayi ye, ntu əfye ɓo nu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Dna n əwo nu n fya ga Shekwoyi gaiciya, əza n wo ɓə la wo kala n əfyi njesnu waa wo latu, ntulonu əfye gaiciyaganunui n awyetui ɓa nyi n Shekwoyi nu.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Nsaiye shi fye la əfyehni pmya n gaiciyanunui ɓəgbetuvyi, nabai fya ɓwa yeye hnihnii ga aje, fye wu aje ye wu aje yeye n loloi, kwoi kwnu n ədu gbmanyi. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ntuge a la fye shna ma, toge n nyabye bwobwoi m, ama ədo n kwo taa bwo m, dna n Shekwoyi ɓədagbma wyewyeyi nya tnadoshnai. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ntuge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Azanyikwoci vnyanya wu ngye agbegbe nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">jesnu əɓa latu vnyanya n wu ngye amamawyí bmana nya nu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">agbegbe zhni ɓa ɓwa jesnu amamawyí ɓa vnyiya,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ama Dagayi ɓədagbma myignyi lo nyalonyalo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Njesnu ɓədagbma yi nu nyi n a ɓə zhni fye əkwo waazi nyi.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Aɓyipwutu fyi n Shekwoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ntucenu, fye la aɓəshinmì kwnuya vnyanya n azawyidnai, n kwocednai vnyanya, n shewoi, ɓədo n aza ayewnuyai dəhodəhoi pyai. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ngye aɓyipwutu, fye kwnufnafna ɓeɓegbma tnadodnai zafnu nya, n əkwoi nu n fye ɓa myi fya mwa fyi n əfye gnyignyi, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />nsaiye shikwonyi fye la Dagayi bmyabmya towo nyi.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuta wyewyeyi n aza aknyiknyiyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Shi fye kwu ɓe da Kirisiti Kwuta wyewyeyi; azanyikwoci ɓə la əkwo aɓəna, ama Shekwoyi wo la kwo knyi njesnu n apma yaakwoi n əwo aba. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Əfyehni ce, ngye akwuta awyewyeyi, a gnyi ai mi fye nu n zhni zafnu pwuwa, fya kwu zhni Pirisiti ofye gyigyiyi, fya kwnu zafnu anyakwnukwnu agwogwoi n Shekwoyi aba ntu Yeisu Kirisiti ɓo. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ntuge dna n Nyakagyigyiyi, kwo ncei da lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Gyewye, mi shi kwuta nu dna n Siyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">nyaknuɓwakwonu kwuta knyiknyiyi jesnu apmayaakwo nya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">jesnu əza n wa kpema kwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">vnyinkwo taa wo əwo m nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Nsaiye əfye n fye kwu gaiciyaga nyi, kwuta ye n apma yaakwoi lo. Ama aza yi n ɓa to ga gaiciya nyi m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Kwuta n anyamiyi ɓə na kwo aɓo nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">kwo la zè ɓwakwonu kwuta,<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />njesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Kwuta n kwo zhni azanyikwoci ɓai knyiabwonyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">njesnu apmá n kwo zhni ɓai myiya.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ba ɓə knyiabwonyi ntuge ɓa to ɓə vyi ɓəgbetu m, n əkwo nu ɓə zhni əɓo n a ɓə zhni ɓa ntuce nu nyi.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ama fye zhni aza aknyiknyiyi nu. Fye zhni abeɓyi nu Pirisiti ofye nya, əbyé gyigyiyi, Shekwoyi nyaɓwa knyiknyii, nabai fya dna əwo cici əwyi n əwo nu ɓə yi fye n wyegbma wa lo fye fyi n əwo bwuznagna bmyabmyai. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />N sapa fye to ɓə zhni aza nu m, ama nsaiye fye kwu zhni Shekwoyi aza; n sapa fye to ɓə gwo snusnugye m, ama nsaiye fye kwu snusnugye ɓwa.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyìgyi Shekwoyi dnawo dna n ashnagbayi atasni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Anugwnudo ayeyeyi, mi tna fye aɓwa, ngye aknyidoda n okwnula, fye la aɓwakwnu n leifyi aɓəpwawo n ɓa snu okwnu n əfye wyewyeyii nyi. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Fye gyianyì manai fyi n ashnagbayi atasni, nabai kwo ɓai gye nge fye zhni əɓənukwoi nu, ɓa ɓá gye əfye atnutnu manai əwye njesnu ɓa la Shekwoyi tu əwyi n wo ɓə ɓe yi gnaɓyi ncei. <verse eid="1PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Fye kwu əfyehni tukwo ga fyi n azanyikwoci ikwo dəhodəhoi akwnu ntu n Dagayi ɓo: kwo n əsu aba, ngye ikwo duduyi, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />kwo n agwomna aba, aza n wo tnu n ɓai ɓa ta aza yi n ɓa zhni ɓənukwoi, njesnu ɓa ci aza yi n ɓa zhni əɓo n kwo wu cewo. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ntuge Shekwoyi ɓəye nu nge n aɓo manaizhnii, fye ɓa kwnu amama agbe to ɓa da aɓəda tnagənyikpeyi nya m. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Fye gyianyì ngye aza aloloiya, ama fye to zhniapma n əfye loloyai kwaa zè nukwoi nya m; fye gyianyì ngye Shekwoyi afyenu. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Fye wu zahozahoyi mwamwaga hnihnii nya, fye ye agaiciyagayi apwuwa, fye wo Shekwoyi ədna, fya ga əsu mwamwa.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Afyenu, dna n Shekwoyi ədnawo mwamwaga nya, fye ga əfyehni tukwo n əfye adagayi akwnu toge n ɓwasnu n aza yi aba n ɓa zhni aɓo manai njesnu n gənyikpei m, ama n aza yi aba ce n ɓa zhinazhizhii. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ntuge kwo zhni əɓo manai nu, n əza ɓwa əmì dna n snasna azhnìgye tnaɓənukwoi zhni nya, ntuge wo kpəlo nge Shekwoyi gyewye lo. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ama kwo ɓaa zè əho cici ɓo n wunanu, n a lu ho ntu ɓənukwoizhni ɓo, ha ɓwamì n kwoi a? Ama n ha gyeazhnì ntu ɓəmanaizhni ɓo haa ɓwamì n kwoi, dəye zhni cici ɓo nu n Shekwoyi abye. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />A ɓə yi fye ntu ɓəye ɓo nu, ntuge Kirisiti ɓə kwu azhnìgye ntu fye ɓo, waa əfye ya shi fye, nge fye vyi n əwo apitaɓwi.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />“Wo to ɓə zhni leifyi m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">njesnu a to ɓə snu wo n akatai dna n əwo əgbe m.”<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />She a ɓə knyi wo akpmi, wo to ɓə gbata m; she wo ɓə gyeazhnì, wo to ɓə yi ɓənukwoi kpe aza m. N əkwoɓwi, waa əwohni ya dna n əza akwnu n wo da owa dna n gaiciya nyi. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />“Əwo n wohni tukwoi wo ɓə la əyi aleifyi kwu” dna n wo nayi tu n znudu, nabai n yi ɓa kwu zè afyífyii ga aleifyizhni njesnu ya gyianyì ntu n ɓəfyecezhni ɓo, “ntu əwo aci ɓo nu n fye kwu kágna ɓwa.” <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ntuge, “Fye ɓə wu ngye aknyi nu n ɓa ɓəlo ɓai ɓwuaba,” ama nsaiye fye la jezeɓe da əfye Knayi n Ɓəwyednayi əfye awyewyeyi nya.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Anyikwo, n ɓwasnu n zokwo ye, fye kwu əfyehni ga fyi n əfyehni anu akwnu, nabai n əzaho n ɓa n wo taa kna gaiciya ɓədagbma tnubwa lo m, n a ɓa myi a gnyi wo ɓe ncei n tna aɓədagbma dai, ama ntu əwo anyikwo alu ɓo, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />she wo gye əfye anyìgyi tnadodnai nya ɓədo n mwamwagai. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />A to gye əfye bmyabmya ntu nyigwnu zhni əbmyi nya ɓo nu, ngye tukwoyi abazhni n duwyi ɓədo n azinali akayai kwo aje ayeda m.<verse eid="1PE 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />N əkwoɓwi, kwo la zè ədo nu n kwo dna n əho mi, bmyabmya n kwo ta toya m, əhohni wnashi nya ɓədo n zafnu pəceye nyai, n kwo n apma yaakwoi lo n Shekwoyi aba nyi. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ntuge zokwo nu nyi n anyikwo agyigyiyi n sapa, n ɓa ɓə n awyei tu n Shekwoyi nyi, ɓə zhni ɓai zhni əɓahni nyigwnu. Ɓa ɓə kwu aɓwa yafyi n əɓahni anu akwnu, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />ngye Saratu, n wo ɓə ga Ibrahim mwamwa woi yi wo nge Dagayi nyi. Fye zhni əwo anyigwnu nu n fya zhni əɓo n kwo bmya njesnu to fya ga ədna aba m.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Anu, n ɓwasnu n zokwo ye, fye sase n əfye anyikwoi fyi n gənyikpe, fyei zhni əɓo n kwo gwo fya zhni ga ɓa. Fye ga ɓa mwamwa ngye əfye azabayi akalágbai njesnu ngye aza n ɓa kwnu nyaga shebmyashi wyewyeyi nya gwo, nabai n nyaho taa kpma fye aduwazhni wo m.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azhnìgye ntu ɓəmanaizhni ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />N kpmasnu, əfye vnyanya, fye kwu zhi n bwugbai gbmanyi, fye kwu zhni asnusnugyeyi. Fye ye n ajei, fye ɓwa bwugba n ajei, njesnu na atukwoi gbàgbài. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Fye to gba ɓənukwoi əta n ɓənukwoi m, kwo akpmi n akpmii m. N əkwoɓwi, gba ɓənukwoi əta n anabəlikai nu, ntuge n dəye ɓo nu, n a ɓə yi fye nabai fya gyi əgwú anabəlika nya. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ntuge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Zahozahoyi n wo ɓa ye wyewyeyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">njesnu woi gye anyipyei amanai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">ɓəshishinu waa əwo nyitala wnashi n ɓənukwoi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">njesnu əwo əgbe n ɓəda wyidna nya.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Ɓəshishinu wa pmyiya n ɓənukwoi njesnu wa zhni ɓəmanai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">ɓəshishinu wa zna bwugbafu shni njesnu wa vyi kwo əɓo.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ntuge Dagayi awye wulo n ɓəfyeceyi ɓwa nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">njesnu əwo atnubwa gwuya lo ga əwo aduwazhni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">ama Dagayi awye gnyiapaapa lo n aza yii n ɓa zhni aɓənukwoi.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nyika nu ɓa zhni ho əkpí, hoi n əwyenyii lo ha zhni ɓəmanai a? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ama kwo n ho ɓa gyeazhnì nu ntu ɓəfyecezhni ɓo, ho n anabəlikai lo. “Fye to wo əɓa ədna m; fye to vnyivnyi m.” <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ama fyi n əfye abwugba, fye ga Kirisiti mwamwa ngye Dagayi. Fye kwu zhi ciici n fyehnii yeyeyi, fya dna zahozahoyi ɓəgbe n wo nya əfye ɓətukwo əfye awyetu nya. Ama fye zhni dəye pəceye n mwamwagai, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />fye la əfye tukwovnyi shi ntnaɓətu, nabai aza n ɓa da ɓəshinmì aɓədada ntu n əfye alu manai ɓo dna n Kirisiti, n vnyinkwo ɓa wo ɓa ntu n əɓa aza aye wnuya ɓo. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ntuge kwo gnabmya lo, ngye kwo zhni Shekwoyi ɓəye nu, əza wa gyeazhnì ntu n əɓo manai zhni ɓo, a fa ntu n ɓənukwoizhni ɓo. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ntuge Kirisiti ɓə kwu azhnìgye ce znugbmanyi ntu n aleifyi ɓo, ɓəfyeceyi ntu atna-aɓəfyeceyi ɓo, wa ɓe n fyei n Shekwoyi aba. A ɓə la wo wu dna n nayi, ama aa wyewyeyi ga wo dna n Zafnu. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Shi a ɓə la wyewyeyi ga wo, wa lo wa dnawyi ga azafnu gwugwuyi fyi n zhalu, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />ga aza yi n ɓa ɓə znu ɓəgbetu gna aye bəgyé n ɓa la duya nyi, əsa n Shekwoyi ɓə pmi n bwugbaɓwai dna n Nuhu anyipyei, əsa n a ɓə mi əya nuwnanya nyi. Aza ɓə ɓwa fyi fyewyi nu n kwo, aza nyimwanyimwa nu vnyanya, n ɓa ɓə pwo n nuwna yi. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Njesnu nuwna ye zhni əznù nu batizima nya, n əkwo nu gnyi fye nsaiye ce nyi; toge cegye kpmaya nayi nya m, ama ɓəshishi tukwovnyi tnaɓətui nya n Shekwoyi aba. Əkwo nu gnyi fye dna n Yeisu Kirisiti kalala, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />n wo la lodna n əshemi njesnu wo gnyilo n Shekwoyi ɓwaizheɓwa; n kwnusnu n amaləkai, n aikwoi ɓədo n akalái n əɓahni ga fyi n əwo akwnu.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Anyìgyi ntu Shekwoyi ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi Kirisiti ɓə kwu azhnìgye dna n əwo nayi nyi, fye la fyehni ye ce n alu ye pyai, ntuge zahozahoyi n wo gyeazhnì dna n nayi wo la leifyi ga avnu nu. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Ntucenu, ɓa to ɓə ye gyianyì n ɓa n ɓai ce nyi, ntu zanyikwoci aɓəpwawo nukwoi ɓo m, ama n əkwoɓwi ntu Shekwoyi ɓəye ɓo. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ntuge əsa n kwo la duya nyi, fye ɓə kwu əsa gyi n mwa fyei zhni aɓo n ashnagbayi zhni; fyei gyianyì fyi n asisiɓozhni, shakpe, jefyi, awyefna kasa, n jezhniwyiɓei, ɓədo n ashnagba asisi nyai. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Cei wo ɓa nge fye ta dnaɓwado lo n ɓai n əɓa anyìgyi tukwognanakwo nya m, anyigyifasa nya, njesnu ɓai knyi fye akpmi ɓai je knyi. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ama ɓəshishinu ɓai ga wo nyadokwu, əwo n wo n əwohnii kwukwui lo woi da owa tu n azawyewyeyi ɓədo n afyífyii. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ntucenu a kwu waazi nabagyi manai zhni ga aza yi n ɓa kwu fyí nyi, nabai n a ɓə myi a da ɓa owa, shi zanyikwoci n aɓəknawna zhni ntu n nayi ɓo, ama ɓa gyianyì dna n zafnu ga Shekwoyi.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Aɓo vnyanya azoba kwo la wo vyivyiwyi. Ntucenu fye kwu zhigwu njesnu fyaa bwugba yami, nabai n fye ɓa myi fya zhniaduwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Əɓo n kwo dulo vnyanya, fye wu aje yeye n loloi, ntuge yeye kwu aleifyi bəgyé pwuanya. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Fye wna ajeakna n tna awyice. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Zahozahoyi n fye, wo zhniapma n əwo nyagai n wo la gwo nyi, nabai wa zhni azaje tnutnu n cei, n zhni atnutnuyi gbənui Shekwoyi shebmyashi nya, fyi n azokwo gbowogbowo. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Əzahozahoyi n wa daɓo, wo da kwo n zhni əza n wo da Shekwoyi ɓədagbma cimcim. Əza n wo zhni tnutnu, wo zhni kwo n kalái n Shekwoyi ga nyi, nabai fyi n aɓo vnyanya Shekwoyi ɓa ɓwa cici dna n Yeisu Kirisiti. Latu zhni əwo nya nu ɓədo n kalái nyalonyalo. Aamyi.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azhnìgye ntuge ho zhni Kirisitivyiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Anugwnudo ayeyeyi, ce to wo fye ntu amwumwu asnasnayi ɓo, n ɓa ɓe da fye ɓa mwu fye gye nyi m, kwa zè ngye əɓo wowoi nu snu fye m. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ama fye nya agbmada shikwonyi fye kwu aɓwa dnado ń Kirisiti azhnìgye nyi, nabai n fye ɓə ɓwa agbmada yaakwo əsa n əwo latu ɓə kpeyawu. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />N a knyi fye akpmi ntu Kirisiti əye ɓo, fye n anabəlikai lo, ntuge Zafnu latu nya ɓədo n Shekwoyi nyai yakpe lo n fye. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />N fya gyeazhnì, kwo to la zè ntu zawu ɓo kwo əvyiwyi, kwo aɓəkawuzhni dəhodəhoi, kwo ge aɓoaɓwafyi ɓo m. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Dudulonu, n fya gyeazhnì ngye Kirisitivyiyi, vnyinkwo to wo fye m, ama fye ci Shekwoyi nge ayi fye n əye yii nu. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ntuge əsa kwo la si n á ɓa ya owada n Shekwoyi pwuwa; njesnu ń kwa ya n yii nu, knyiɓei nu ɓə zhni n aza yi aba, n ɓa ta vyi Shekwoyi nabagyi manai lo m ma? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Njesnu, “Ngye kwo dnaɓo lo ɓəfyeceyi woi pwo, knyiɓei nu ɓə zhni atnashekwodnawoyi n leifyizhniyi a?” <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ntulonu nsayi, aza yi n ɓa gyeazhnì vyi Shekwoyi ɓəmwi, ɓa kwu əɓahni ga fyi n Əɓazhniyi gbenui akwnu, njesnu ɓa gwodu n əɓo manai zhnii.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəda ga abyeda n aknyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Ga azakwoyi n ɓa fyilo n fye, mi tna fye aɓwa, shi mi zhni əfye zakwoyi ədo nu nyi, jesnu ɓəgbmii Kirisiti azhnìgye nya, ngye əza n wo ɓə kwnu latu gwo əsa n a ɓə la kwo kpeyawu nyi: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Fye kwu zhni Shekwoyi gəluce aknyiknayi, n ɓa fyi n əfye akwnu nyi, fya ka ɓa əwye; toge n a ye kwo yeyefyi fye nu m, ama ntuge fye kwu əfyehni ga, shi Shekwoyi ncei pma fya kwu zhni; toge fyei zna gyiba gyifyi nya shni m, ama aza n ɓa shnishni ɓa zhni tnutnu; <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />toge fyei ye aɓo kpe aza yi n a ncei n fyi n əfye akwnu nyi m, ama fya kwu zè aza amwutu nya ga gəluce. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Njesnu she knyiknayi Tukwoda ɓə kpeyaɓe, fye ɓə gwo fnunyi latu nya n kwo taa toya m kpeekpe.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Əfye ce, n fye zhni aɓyikasa nyi, kwu əfyehni ga fyi n əfye abyeda akwnu. Əfye vnyanya, fye kwu əfyehni pwi n tukwogba n aje aba, ntuge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">“Shekwoyi gnyiapaapa n tukwomwayii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">ama wo wu bmyashi n tukwogbayi aba.”<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ntucenu, fye kwu əfyehni tukwogba, dna n Shekwoyi əɓwa ikwodudui nya, nabai n wo ɓə la fye kwuwu n əsai bmyabmya. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Fye kwu əfye aɓəsa vnyanya fa fyi n əwo akwnu ntuge wo pa əfye əɓo lo, woi dna fye wye ciici.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Fye kwu zhigwu jesnu fya kwu əfye abwugba yaami. Əfye nuwnuyi shetam laɓa lo woi shegwnu ngye gaba ɓwuciyi woi zna əza shni n wo ɓa saya. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Fye na wo aɓo, fya kwu gnyiagnyi n myizhi n gaiciyaga, ntuge fye kpəlo ge agaiciyagayi apwuwa n anyìpata vnyanya fyilo ɓai gyeazhnì ye pya nu.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Njesnu Shekwoyi shebmyashi da vnyanya, n wo ɓə yi fye fyi n latu nyalonyalo nya dna n Kirisiti nyi, shi fye ɓə kwu azhnìgye əsa fyewyi, əwo n əwohnii, wo ɓə la fye zhishni jesnu woi kwu fye zhni akalada, n myizhi jesnu n əmìfyii dəidəi. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Kalá zhni əwo nya nu nyalonyalo. Aamyi.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amisaga kpmasnui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Mi kanya ye n Sila bmazhnii nu, ń mi n woi la n zhni əmizado gbenuyi. Mi kwu nyaka ka ga fye n ɓwasnu pyikwnu, mii myi fye agwuzhi jesnu mii gbmiɓo nge dəye nu zhni shebmyashi hnihnii Shekwoyi nya. Fye kwu myizhi n kwo. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Nyikwo n wo nyi n Babyila nyi, knyiknyiyi n kwnusnu n fyei, wo tnu fye lo n əwo gnaɓyii, nlonu ce əmi nugwnu Marukwus tnu fye lo n gnaɓyii. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Fye kwu aje ɓyigna n ɓwadodna yeye nyai. Bwugbafu kwo kwnusnu n fyei vnyanya, əfye n fye fyi n Kirisiti nyi.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>